# Azure Cloud, DevOps & AKS Interview Guide

> A practical interview bank for Azure/DevOps engineers with 4–8 years of experience.

This guide is structured to help you prepare for real-world interview conversations, not just textbook definitions. The focus is on design thinking, troubleshooting, trade-offs, automation, security, and operations.

## Quick preparation strategy

1. Learn the concepts first.
2. Practice explaining why and when to choose a design.
3. Discuss trade-offs: cost vs reliability, security vs simplicity, speed vs control.
4. Be ready to troubleshoot live scenarios and explain root-cause thinking.
5. Link answers to Azure Well-Architected principles: reliability, security, cost optimization, operational excellence, and performance efficiency.

