## Final interview tips

- Speak in terms of architecture and trade-offs, not just definitions.
- Show a structured thought process when troubleshooting.
- Explain both the technical solution and the business reason behind it.
- Use examples from Azure, networking, CI/CD, and Kubernetes.
- Be prepared to talk about security, monitoring, resilience, cost, and automation.

This guide is meant to help you sound confident, structured, and practical in technical interviews.
